{"data": {"__GLOBAL": {"_ATTACH_BASE_VIEW": "img.nga.cn/attachments"}, "__U": {"60916468": {"uid": 60916468, "username": "UID:60916468", "credit": 135537216, "medal": "272", "reputation": "61_669,128_1005,147_15", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 39, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1567950654, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 3631, "rvrc": 12, "money": 19999, "thisvisit": 1788148677, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537216, "group_bit_buf": 2048, "buffs": {"129": [[1581016, 129, 0, 60916468, 1786152653, 1788916286, 2048, 0]]}}, "150058": {"uid": 150058, "username": "UID:150058", "credit": 135537218, "medal": "272,207,157,92", "reputation": "28_30,61_0,147_775,130_10", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 73, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1123989606, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 42189, "rvrc": 29, "money": 90765, "thisvisit": 1788091519, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537218, "buffs": {"131": [[1083362, 131, 64312853, 150058, 1787910267, 1788169467, 11, 0]]}}, "__GROUPS": {"39": ["学徒", 98528, 39], "73": ["学徒", 360672, 73]}, "__MEDALS": {"272": ["272.gif", "棒棒糖", "叔叔请你吃棒棒糖", 272], "207": ["207.gif", "爆竹声中旧岁除", "一支红杏出墙来", 207], "157": ["157.gif", "王者之剑", "王者之剑活动纪念", 157], "92": ["92.gif", "小心死亡之翼-", "2011年大灾变开服纪念", 92]}, "__REPUTATIONS": {"147": {"60916468": 15, "150058": 775, "0": "大时代"}}}, "__R": [{"pid": 879558607, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 40, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 13:47", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我到现在不知道午后拉这一根是为什么，你们聊半天也没人给什么有用信息，就纯是因为中午韩指在涨吗？[s:ac:汗]<br/><br/>这如果上不去，感觉和临死之人回光返照的那一哆嗦很像了，有点招笑", "lou": 140, "content_length": 154, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787636862}, {"pid": 879559665, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 11, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 13:58", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "反正如果能横到尾盘，管它这那的，先来两口尝尝咸淡，又到了我最喜欢的尾盘买入赌第二天消息的超短环节[s:ac:茶]", "lou": 141, "content_length": 94, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787637527}, {"pid": 879574361, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 41, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 16:06", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879570705,47288722,1467]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67264205]HongKenn[/uid] (2026-08-25 15:36):[/b]<br/><br/>低位要乐观，不要等到4300再乐观，跌了看跌涨了看涨不可取<br/>3890，跌下去低点止损也就是150点，向上可是无限！<br/>屏蔽杂音，干就完了！[s:a2:自戳双目][/quote]<br/><br/>说得好[s:ac:茶]3800不敢做，说明觉得3800是顶，那不就是熊市？还来参与什么？<br/><br/>你们狼叔叔从来没丢过底仓，因为他从来不觉得这个位置是大顶，这就叫知行合一，因为信牛，所以不空", "lou": 142, "content_length": 159, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879570705, "postdatetimestamp": 1787645202}, {"pid": 879581896, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 24, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 17:14", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879578105,47288722,1468]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=41412356]兴趣使然的PRODUCER[/uid] (2026-08-25 16:40):[/b]<br/><br/>问个问题 假如大家都知道且认为英伟达财报出来后会跌 那做空不是捡钱吗？[/quote]<br/><br/>我去，不早说<br/><br/>那今天尾盘卖出，等英伟达财报出了之后再捡尸体，不是稳赚？醍醐灌顶啊", "lou": 143, "content_length": 83, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879578105, "postdatetimestamp": 1787649243}, {"pid": 879591979, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 32, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 18:59", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "[E1787655606 0 0]\t", "content": "政策市场你们还真聊起业绩了，真有业绩能自给自足要你们这帮韭菜干嘛的，不就是靠市场融钱来发展吗，主次不分<br/><br/>为什么新能源有业绩了反而跌，因为有业绩了就不需要拐杖了啊，a股就是那根拐杖<br/><br/>利益相关，我现在一毛钱半导体仓位没有，但是我也不会无脑看空，因为国产链的操作思路是要结合a股语境的", "lou": 144, "content_length": 272, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787655562}, {"pid": 879606494, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 9, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-25 21:53", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[b]Reply to [pid=879605856,47288722,1476]Reply[/pid] Post by [uid=41412356]兴趣使然的PRODUCER[/uid] (2026-08-25 21:45)[/b]实名给你点个赞[s:ac:赞同]炒股就是要有气势，即便是亏到本金又如何了？输人不输阵", "lou": 145, "content_length": 105, "reply_to": 879605856, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1787665999}, {"pid": 879633016, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 27, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 08:52", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879632052,47288722,1481]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67165063]熊猫射手[/uid] (2026-08-26 08:44):[/b]<br/><br/>狗队买科创50买了一个月了，结果走的最区的就是科创[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/><br/>等过一段时间科创如日中天的时候，裁判当着我们的面卖筹，我估计还要有一大堆人说裁判没格局卖飞了[s:ac:哭笑]", "lou": 146, "content_length": 95, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879632052, "postdatetimestamp": 1787705574}, {"pid": 879633999, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 33, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 09:01", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "能不能等我卖完了再泄啊[s:ac:嘲笑1]就这么没耐心，我正出货呢你搁这砸盘，这不是捣乱吗", "lou": 147, "content_length": 68, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787706092}, {"pid": 879640725, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 32, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 09:51", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "看来以后1.5we才能算地量，今天这种算是正常量能", "lou": 148, "content_length": 45, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787709088}, {"pid": 879648658, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 9, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 10:43", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "今天给药明吸死了，难绷", "lou": 149, "content_length": 22, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787712220}, {"pid": 879651311, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 24, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 11:00", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "这里哪怕只补1000亿量能都上去了，内资是真没格局", "lou": 150, "content_length": 46, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787713237}, {"pid": 879670420, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 7, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 13:32", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879669963,47288722,1522]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=38140916]huohuo277[/uid] (2026-08-26 13:28):[/b]<br/><br/>但凡有另外几个板块有持续性，大家也不会只盯着科技吧。天天疯狂轮动，科技的钱怎么出去。还不如在科技里面套着，起码不会亏更多。[/quote]<br/><br/>但是有一说一，万一有哪个板块真的出现持续性，又会变得和之前的商业航天和存储一样，发了疯地拉然后一地鸡毛，所以还真不好说到底哪种模式好一点", "lou": 151, "content_length": 141, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879669963, "postdatetimestamp": 1787722354}, {"pid": 879670604, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 19, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 13:34", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=879670453,47288722,1522]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=65329649]zippo578[/uid] (2026-08-26 13:33):[/b]<br/><br/>量能别缩太狠的话<br/>一会估计能转放<br/>因为昨天下午最后1小时缩太多了[s:ac:哭笑]<br/>不过这都不重要<br/><br/>现在就看资金来不来科技[/quote]<br/><br/>为啥资金会来科技[s:ac:哭笑]这都最后一天了，我都知道今天不适合开仓，他们大不了明天挂涨停板追就好，一旦出事可不好出来", "lou": 152, "content_length": 107, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 879670453, "postdatetimestamp": 1787722463}, {"pid": 879675703, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 27, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 14:17", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我恨不得英伟达财报下一秒就发布[s:ac:茶]", "lou": 153, "content_length": 28, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787725058}, {"pid": 879680611, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 8, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-26 14:57", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "又是这种“一切皆在掌握”的收盘[s:ac:嘲笑1]", "lou": 154, "content_length": 28, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787727472}, {"pid": 879743624, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 35, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 07:38", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "赶紧开香槟啊，愣着干什么，一会儿开盘之后就开不了了，今宵有酒今宵醉，反正我先开了[s:ng:呲牙笑]", "lou": 155, "content_length": 78, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787787508}, {"pid": 879748728, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 13, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 08:45", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "给自己做一做战前的心理动员[s:ac:茶]我是有仓位的，我接受一切可能性", "lou": 156, "content_length": 54, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787791517}, {"pid": 879749892, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 30, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 08:54", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我看驻韩美军纯粹吃干饭的啊[s:ac:茶]已经不是一般的南朝鲜统领了，必须出重拳", "lou": 157, "content_length": 62, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787792082}, {"pid": 879750888, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 40, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 09:02", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我近期做的最舒服、最正常的一天，就是南朝鲜休市的那一天，其市场性质和它的国家、文化和民族性一样，仅存在本身就很恶心<br/><br/>对于南朝鲜我的立场是自始至终、一以贯之的蔑视，他今天来偷鸡也不是难以理解的事情", "lou": 158, "content_length": 192, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787792575}, {"pid": 879764770, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 60916468, "type": 0, "score": 22, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-27 10:39", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "今天这根红k做成不就是红三兵？3926一突破，场外立马源源不断的买盘进来补量", "lou": 159, "content_length": 71, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1787798348}], "__T": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "topic_misc": "AgLQUfU", "subject": "自立自强，科学技术打头阵----救赎版", "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 13428